{"product_id":"visionary-smartwatch","title":"Visionary Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contains\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1 × ZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e1 × User Manual\u003cbr\u003e1 × Warranty Card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary Smartwatch combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Visionary is built to keep up with your lifestyle day and night.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display:\u003cbr\u003e1.85-inch AMOLED HD full-touch screen with stunning clarity and vibrant visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeamless Bluetooth Calling*  Single-chip Bluetooth 5.3 delivers stable, clear call quality directly from your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Customizable Watch Faces* Switch between built-in dials or cloud-based designs to suit your mood and style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Comprehensive Health Tracking*  Real-time heart rate monitoring, SpO₂ tracking, sleep analysis, and female health tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Fitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes* Multiple workout profiles supported for accurate performance and activity tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Notifications \u0026amp; Controls \u003c\/strong\u003eStay updated with instant alerts and manage music, camera, and weather with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP68 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e  Designed to handle sweat, rain, and splashes for worry-free daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to 15 days of typical use on a single charge for uninterrupted performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.85-inch AMOLED HD, full-touch screen\u003cbr\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and camera control)\u003cbr\u003eHealth Sensors: Heart rate, SpO₂, sleep tracking, female health monitoring\u003cbr\u003eSports: Multiple sport modes with motion tracking\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance: IP68\u003cbr\u003eBattery Life: Up to 15 days\u003cbr\u003eCharging: Magnetic charging cable\u003cbr\u003eBuild: Stylish, durable design with premium finish\u003cbr\u003eWarranty: 365 Days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Choose ZERO Visionary?\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable it’s your complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to track your health, boost productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Visionary delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP68 water resistance, it’s designed for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silicone","offer_id":50583080632598,"sku":"22948","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50583080435990,"sku":"22947","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown Silicone","offer_id":50583080501526,"sku":"22949","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":50583080599830,"sku":"22950","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Olive Green Silicone","offer_id":50583080534294,"sku":"22946","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","off